    "body": "I would like to suggest the addition of some way for a **learner who has just completed the Instructor Training Workshop to search the database and verify whether they have previously submitted Instructor Training Request Form.**\r\n\r\nI believe I may have filled the form out a few months ago, but am unsure. I was told the easiest way to do that would be to send an email to checkout@carpentries.org, which I have. However, we might be able to reduce the checkout@carpentries.org's inbox burden a bit by doing this.",
